{"id":"n15020-1-7","stage":2,"title":"뒷문 · 后门","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15020-1-7-1","ko":"서울에서는 버스를 앞문으로 타.","zh":"在首尔要从前门上车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서울에서는","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"서울에서는","audio":"/audio/3dfac1957b0bfc222ffe.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서울에서는","audio":"/audio/3dfac1957b0bfc222ffe.mp3"}},{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스를","audio":"/audio/4ab439d0845f5096c8da.mp3"}},{"text":"앞문으로","meaning":"前门","explanation":"앞문：前门；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞문","audio":"/audio/ab6ffd78dd27b1870d9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16163","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞문으로","audio":"/audio/eb37a7e00a2b666a9700.mp3"}},{"text":"타.","meaning":"乘坐、上车","explanation":"타다：乘坐。타 是 타다 的非敬语句末形式；本句说明在首尔乘巴士时从前门上车，不是 하다 的经营义。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타","audio":"/audio/7e40449e6f383f05b54a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ab6ffd78dd27b187","term":"앞문","zh":"前门","audio":"/audio/ab6ffd78dd27b1870d9e.mp3","entryId":"16163","definition":"位于房间或建筑前部的门。","pronunciation":["암문"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"乘坐","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46c7633e47d4cee2d5ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"i